import ACUIHE.Optimized.Optimized
import ACUIHE.Optimized.Shortcut
import ACUIHE.Optimized.FILO

/-!
Public imports for the three optimized ACUIhE solver implementations.

* `ACUIHE.Optimized.Optimized.solveACUIhE?` is the reachable-state solver.
* `ACUIHE.Optimized.Shortcut.solveACUIhE?` is the witness-carrying shortcut solver.
* `ACUIHE.Optimized.FILO.solveACUIhE?` is the exact FILO solver.

The original implementation remains available under `ACUIHE.Solver`.
-/
